	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ego, reverende pater, hodie demum, qui est 17. huius mensis, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>tuas accipio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Remittam, si possum, omnia bona fide.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Scripsi ante 8 dies tumultuarie admodum; sed tunc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nemo erat, cui darem; mitto tamen exemplar illud, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut videas me voluisse satisfacere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">D. <persName>Fridericus</persName> non <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>venit; scribo ad illum omnia, si possum, diligenter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Iam conveni d. <persName ref="p8093">Herculem a Salicibus</persName>; negat ille verum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>esse, quod tamen constantissimus rumor de <persName>Jurtz</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>affirmavit, et dicit <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName> sibi quidem a <persName>Philippo</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>providere, existimare tamen <persName>Philippum</persName> nihil tentaturum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>(Ita posthac non amplius credam omnibus, licet, quae de <persName>Jurtz</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>scripsi, ex consulibus habui ipsis).</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Vigilant Veneti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Die <placeName>3 Ort</placeName> habend ir bottschafft hye gehept, begerend, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>das d. <persName ref="p293">Beccaria</persName> und der schuͦlmeister geurloubet <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>werdind.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Aber man hat inen den bitz nit gelaßen; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>man setzt es der gemeind heym.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Die söllind dorumb <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>meeren; das meer sol gelten.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p293">Beccaria</persName> iam, ut <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>audio, <placeName ref="l93">Clavennae</placeName> est; speramus eum posse ibidem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>locum habere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">D. <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName> hic versatur iam aliquot dies.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Praetendit ille <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>legationem principis; sed pauci credunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Existimavit <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>comitia frequentiora iam futura; ignoravit responsum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>datum pontifici.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Venit, ut confirmaret <persName>Rhetos</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sed edito in hoc libello papistas nostros plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>exasperavit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Multa conquestus coram, quod tu sine <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>causa ab illius amicitia discessisses; sed cum et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ipse quaedam dicturus essem, noluit me audire.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Hoc enim <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vitii habere videtur, ut omnia et dixisse et fecisse <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>solus videri velit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Multa de sacramento dixit sed est <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>lubricus et sibi multa contradicit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Venit ad te ipse, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ita recepit, et dicit se cupere tecum redire in gratiam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>De <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> concilio, quo dicit se quoque profecturum, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>multa (ego credo, quantum possum); ipse te edocebit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Dicit 4 cardinales ibi legatos versari et inter hos <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>cardinalem <persName>Mantuanum</persName> et <persName>Hosium</persName>, praeterea circiter 40 <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>episcopos.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Misissem libellum d. <persName ref="p3375">Vergerii</persName>; sed quia ipse <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ad vos venit, secum feret.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Si ad concilium profecturus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>est, non ipse solus loquetur, sed et alios audire cogetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Nunc non plura possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Plura, si opus est, scribam cum evangelista <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l294">Luggarnensi</placeName>; nunc aliorsum avocor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende pater, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>cum tuis omnibus quam felicissime.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri et inprimis <persName ref="p8093">Hercules a Salicibus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>17. octobris anno 1561. festinantissime; non relegi.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Remittam tua cum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>evangelista.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>lingero</persName>, ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antis<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>titi vigilantissimo, domino et patrono suo semper honorando.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName><note type="misc">von anderer Hand.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
